tale intent; an approval never revives a stale frame", "Approval resolution mirrors Cognate-Workbench's seaForgeCall because Cognate 0.6.2 exports none (readiness debt: export it from Cognate)", "No HTTP route answers an approval: that would need Workbench-style Host/Origin guards; resolution is an application call for the operator", "IS6 (RealityTrace observation, settlement reference) and IS2/IS7 (SPEC-CR candidate) remain", "Cognate 0.6.2's execution_trace stamps created_at with the current time, so re-deriving the trace from the committed event matches RealityTrace's hash only within the same second; Cognate #61 (released as 0.6.3) makes it a pure function of the event; re-vendor before relying on the hash check", "IS2 (payment, OQ-IDM-02) and IS7 settlement semantics for navigation intents need a SPEC-CR candidate; without a verifier, J02 settlement stays unsettled"], "next": "Re-vendor Cognate 0.6.3 (deterministic traces); then the J02 gate in godspeed-readiness and the IS2/IS7 SPEC-CR candidate.", "decisions": ["DEC-T10-A", "DEC-T10-B", "DEC-T10-C"], "evidence": [".agents/evidence/horizon/T10/SUMMARY.md", "test/J02-live.test.ts", "test/app.test.ts", "~/projects/godspeed-readiness/docs/proposals/P04-horizon-governed-operate.md"], "changed": ["src/adapters/settlement.ts", "src/capabilities/navigation-settlement.ts", "src/app.ts", "src/runtime/create.ts", "test/J02-live.test.ts"], "spec": {"id": "HORIZON-001", "version": "1.0.1", "status": "frozen", "sha256": "14a42936fe3a17c3726ee57fbc9278fd6f6e92276f67519fd9bf0f605f3324a4"}}
